# The capsule machine and its upgrade tree: it starts broken (one chute, dead lights); fixing it up
# adds chutes, lights and fever, shiny balls. The upgrades page shows the tree.
from after_tutorial
view full
tab machine
expect fits
shot machine
pull 1 0.0
shot lever_down
wait 1.2
shot popped
click "upgrades"
wait 0.3
expect fits
shot tree
fix tape
pull 1 1.8
shot taped
click "upgrades"
bits spring 1
bits glass 2
bits bolt 2
bits gear 2
fix oil
fix flap
fix glass
fix wires
fix chute2
fix chute3
fix shiny 5
fix double 5
wait 0.3
shot tree_fixed
pull 1 1.9
shot intel
wait popup
shot intel_popup
click "lovely"
pull 1 0.4
shot three_chutes
pull 9
pull 1 0.5
shot lucky
wait 1.5
shot fever
expect fits
